= The Harzburg Front

The far-right parties - the NSDAP and the DNVP - have united to form the Harzburg Front, as a force dedicated to the overthrow of the current government.

- @strategy: We must develop a coherent strategy to combat the Right.

@strategy
view-if: afd_urgency < 3
on-arrival: afd_urgency += 1

We do not yet have a coherent strategy for combatting the fascists. We must develop one as soon as possible.
